fix(soporte): ticket-only support line, broader attach wording, require ticket name

- Terms footer: support is offered only via the Soporte ticket channel
  ("Contáctanos desde Soporte.") — dropped the raw mailto; kept the Privacy
  Policy link. Removed the now-unused SUPPORT_EMAIL import.
- Attach button: "Adjuntar imagen o PDF" -> "Adjuntar imagen o documento"
  (EN "Attach image or document").
- Support ticket name field is now REQUIRED (we need to know who we're talking
  to; it auto-fills for logged-in users) — asterisk + client-side validation.

